'''Catfruit Buffet''' is a limited stage that appears on both Saturday and Sunday at 8am~10am, 12pm~2pm, and 7pm~9pm as an alternative to the Catfruit Festival as well as every Wednesday during the [[Meownesday]] event. It is unlocked after clearing [[Empire of Cats]] Chapter 3.

{{Map Stars|112}}

==Explanation==
This event contains three stages, each stage is a trip to all Growing Stage of the same difficulty labeled on each stage, in sequence: [[Growing Green]], [[Growing Purple]], [[Growing Red]], [[Growing Blue]] and finally [[Growing Yellow]], which is ended with the [[Catfruit Jubilee]]. After the player clears one Growing Stage, a message will show up to ask if the player wants to continue on the next Growing Stage. The player can play a total of six stages, and it costs 500 energy per play.

==List of Stages==
*Stage 1: Growing Stages (Hard)
*Stage 2: Growing Stages (Expert)
*Stage 3: Growing Stages (Insane)
*Continuation Stage: [[Catfruit Jubilee]]

==Appearance==
The Catfruit Buffet appears inconsistently on weekends, and is active on both Saturday and Sunday from 8am~10am, 12pm~2pm, and 7pm~9pm. It also appears every Wednesday during the same time slots.

